## Package

- name: sagy
- version: 0.1.0
- edition: 2024
- description: Cross-platform account-aware launcher and scheduler for Google Antigravity CLI (agy).
- dependencies (20): anyhow, argon2, base64, chacha20poly1305, chrono, clap, directories, flate2, fs2, reqwest, rpassword, serde, serde_json, semver, self-replace, sha2, tar, unicode-width, uuid, zip

